# Volkswagen Golf Mk2 five-door hatchback, 1983-1991.
#
# 3,985 mm long, 1,665 mm wide, 1,415 mm high, 2,470 mm wheelbase; 1.3-1.8
# petrol and 1.6 diesel.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Volkswagen_Golf_Mk2
#
# Colours: Tornado Red, Alpine White, Diamond Silver and Black are period Golf
# colours.
#
# Weight: 320 in total (red 90, white 85, silver 80, black 65).
#
# Speed 160 km/h; comfort 95/325 (line). Classes 1,2.
# Dates: 1983-1991 with a road tail to about 2000.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/vw-golf-mk2.blend. References:
# citycars/references/vw-golf-mk2/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia Commons.

